# The learning series is prose and teaching material, not Tock source, and is
# licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 rather than Apache-2.0 OR MIT. Tock's license checker
# hardcodes its own SPDX string (tools/ci/license-checker/src/main.rs:100), so
# these files are excluded from it here. This file itself is repository tooling
# configuration and keeps the Tock license.
README.md
LICENSE
# The chapter pages are CC BY-SA. Anything else a chapter ships -- demo
# sources whose output a figure quotes, for instance -- is ordinary code
# under Tock's licence, and is deliberately left to be checked.
ch*/index.html

# The cover carries the same CC BY-SA header as a chapter, and sits at the root
# of this directory rather than inside a ch*/ one, so the pattern above cannot
# reach it. The leading slash anchors this to learning/ so it stays about the
# cover and does not start ignoring an index.html somewhere else.
/index.html
